{
  # The Commons' default content: every node, tile, drop, biome and ore.
  #
  # Miclone design.md §9: "A mod is a Gene package — `package.gene`, a
  # `mods/<name>/` directory, real imports, real modules. Not a directory of
  # scripts sharing a global table." This manifest declares that package's
  # identity. It is loaded by normal Gene import through `core/mods.gene`
  # (docs/proposals/world.md §13.1: a selected module list and normal Gene
  # loading), not by a runtime loader, and it declares no `^grants`: the Commons
  # has no grant model (§1.2).
  #
  # §9's `depends`/`optional_depends` are not here because this mod depends on
  # nothing and the format has no key for them yet. They arrive with the second
  # module, which is what makes load order a thing to get right rather than a
  # sort over one element.
  ^format 1
  ^name "commons/default"
  ^description "The default game — every node, tile, drop, biome and ore the Commons has"
  ^version "0.1.0"
  ^library {^entry "src/default.gene"}
}
